WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.198
What are you good at? What is 
the work that needs doing?

00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:04.780
And what brings you joy?

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.000
You are most powerful 
in your existing roles,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.767
where you already have specialized&nbsp;
knowledge and robust&nbsp;networks.

00:00:12.235 --> 00:00:14.832
So how might you lean in 
to those&nbsp;talents?

00:00:14.832 --> 00:00:18.422
Can you help your town, company,
church or school

00:00:18.422 --> 00:00:20.873
charge ahead with&nbsp;climate solutions?

00:00:20.873 --> 00:00:26.426
Because what we need is change in
every sector and in every community.

00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:30.385
What are you good at, what&nbsp;
are your areas of expertise?

00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:34.140
Think about your skills, 
resources and&nbsp;networks.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.000
What is the work that needs doing?

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Are there particular climate and&nbsp;
justice solutions that you're keen on?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.203
What brings you joy or satisfaction?

00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:47.023
This is the&nbsp;long haul. 
So it's critical to avoid&nbsp;burnout.

00:00:47.471 --> 00:00:49.680
Choose things that enliven you.

00:00:50.589 --> 00:00:54.909
Find your role if you haven’t already,&nbsp;
encourage others to find theirs.

